| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`tiny-helper@2.0.0\` | registry-mismatch | resolves to https://evil-registry.example.com, not to https://registry.npmjs.org |

### 🔴 high

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`unsigned-thing@1.0.0\` | integrity-missing | no integrity hash for https://registry.npmjs.org/unsigned-thing/-/unsigned-thing-1.0.0.tgz |

### ⚪ low

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`obscure-helper@0.0.1\` | new-transitive | new transitive dependency at node_modules/obscure-helper |
| \`unsigned-thing@1.0.0\` | new-transitive | new transitive dependency at node_modules/unsigned-thing |

<sub>2 added · 1 updated · 1 removed · 1 re-resolved · 1 integrity-changed · 5 packages in the head lockfile (npm v3)</sub>
"
`;

exports[`formatMarkdown > renders every severity, plus warnings 1`] = `
"<!-- lockfile-guard -->

## 🔒 lockfile-guard

**4 findings** across 6 dependency changes — 1 critical, 1 high, 1 medium, 1 low.

### 🛑 critical

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`tiny-helper@2.0.0\` | registry-mismatch | resolves to https://evil-registry.example.com, not to https://registry.npmjs.org |

### 🔴 high

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`tiny-helper@2.0.0\` | install-script-added | postinstall: curl x \\| sh |

### 🟠 medium

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`tiny-helper@2.0.0\` | version-too-fresh | resolves to https://evil-registry.example.com, not to https://registry.npmjs.org |

### ⚪ low

| Package | Rule | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`tiny-helper@2.0.0\` | deprecated | resolves to https://evil-registry.example.com, not to https://registry.npmjs.org |

> [!NOTE]
> Some registry lookups failed, so network rules may be partial:
> - left-pad@1.3.0: 503 Service Unavailable

<sub>2 added · 1 updated · 1 removed · 1 re-resolved · 1 integrity-changed · 5 packages in the head lockfile (npm v3)</sub>
"
`;

